@format 1
@id funnel.resolve-targets
@title Resolve restored funnel targets
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Convert restored target indices into live tab identifiers after the tab set has been rebuilt.
@section I. UI
@tabs Funnel
@flow TB
@related project.restore-session

@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PFunnelTab
@alias rules = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PFunnelRules

[input] Restored tabs become available <input>
- Receive the rebuilt ordered tab records @ tab.PFunnelTargetsResolve(...)
> resolve

[resolve] Resolve every pending target <decision>
- Translate each saved target index into the corresponding live tab identifier @ rules.PFunnelTargetsResolve(...)
? "Saved index is in range" > assigned
? "Saved index is absent or invalid" > cleared

[assigned] Target restored <output>
= The rule points to the corresponding live target tab.

[cleared] Target cleared <output>
= The rule remains usable but has no delivery target.
